Z||000004||DaRkLoRD||11-19-2000||04:12 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by mshill:<BR><B>One of the reasons I like the looks of the Fiero better than the MR2 is because the MR2 is boxy.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>1st gen.. yes. 2nd gen? no way.. hehe..<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
